# Asynchronous interrupts join program order only at a retire boundary (ADR-004 D-4.5,
# kept by ADR-019): an enabled machine-timer interrupt arriving during a tight loop is
# taken with mcause = interrupt | 7 and the loop state is precise.
@name irq-timer-retire-boundary
@verifies funcInterruptSampling funcArchRecoveryRestore funcTrapHold propTrapHoldUntilRedirect
@irq t 400 200
@maxcycles 8000
jal x28, setvec
handler: csrrs x20, mcause, x0
csrrw x0, mie, x0
jal x0, mcont
setvec: csrrw x0, mtvec, x28
li x6, 0x80
csrrs x0, mie, x6
li x6, 0x8
csrrs x0, mstatus, x6
li x5, 0
loop: addi x5, x5, 1
jal x0, loop
mcont: check x20 == 0x80000007
